{"lang": "zh_TW", "eventid": "act51side", "eventName": "人們，我們", "entryType": "ACTIVITY", "storyCode": "PA-4", "avgTag": "行動後", "storyName": "一牆之隔", "storyInfo": "娜塔莉婭四處奔走，在一些人的幫助下，找到了支持巴普洛維奇的關鍵人物——特里波列夫公爵。她設法威脅了公爵，讓他不得不停止對巴普洛維奇的援助。\n", "storyList": [{"id": 0, "prop": "HEADER", "attributes": {"key": "title_test", "is_skippable": "true", "fit_mode": "BLACK_MASK"}}, {"id": 1, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 2, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 3, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 4, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 5, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "66_g12_deitygrypherburgmeeting", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 6, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 7, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 8, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$darkness02_intro", "key": "$darkness02_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 9, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_405_absin_1#1$2", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 10, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 11, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "“……之後，我對照名單，依次與各個學生見面。”", "name": "苦艾"}, "figure_art": "avg_405_absin_1#1$2"}, {"id": 12, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "“與索尼婭不同，他們被送到城牆邊的辦公室與我交談，大多面帶恐懼，什麼都不敢說。”", "name": "苦艾"}, "figure_art": "avg_405_absin_1#1$2"}, {"id": 13, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_177"}}, {"id": 14, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我受夠了！仲裁人閣下，帝國的聽證會怎能縱容如此荒謬的、針對一位清白貴族的侮辱？", "name": "急切的貴族"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_177"}, {"id": 15, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "他曾是陛下親封的樞密官，如果事實真如娜塔莉婭描述的那樣，他又怎麼可能取得這樣的殊榮？", "name": "急切的貴族"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_177"}, {"id": 16, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "任誰都能聽出來，這封信名為懺悔，實際上卻是在責難，我們不能再被謠言牽著走了。", "name": "急切的貴族"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_177"}, {"id": 17, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "據我所知，現場還有一份——", "name": "急切的貴族"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_177"}, {"id": 18, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_405_absin_1#6$2"}}, {"id": 19, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這位大人，無論您對巴普洛維奇大人的“管理藝術”抱有怎樣的欣賞態度，都請不要因此就把娜塔莉婭親筆寫下的血淚稱為謠言。", "name": "苦艾"}, "figure_art": "avg_405_absin_1#6$2"}, {"id": 20, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "您不能因為我們此刻都在溫暖的廳堂中對話，就否認外面正有人因飢寒交迫而戰慄。", "name": "苦艾"}, "figure_art": "avg_405_absin_1#6$2"}, {"id": 21, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_405_absin_1#7$2"}}, {"id": 22, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "畢竟，依照您的想法，如果世界上真的有那麼多苦難，烏薩斯怎麼可能繁榮數百年呢？", "name": "苦艾"}, "figure_art": "avg_405_absin_1#7$2"}, {"id": 23, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_177"}}, {"id": 24, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "卓婭女士，注意你的措辭。聽證會尊重你烈士子女的身分，出於信任和對公正的索求讓你來輔助作證，不是讓你來這裡侮辱貴族的！", "name": "急切的貴族"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_177"}, {"id": 25, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_405_absin_1#6$2"}}, {"id": 26, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "仲裁委員會明鑑，我分明是在維護一位真正的貴族，我絕不容忍任何人輕率地用“謠言”去汙衊她。", "name": "苦艾"}, "figure_art": "avg_405_absin_1#6$2"}, {"id": 27, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_177"}}, {"id": 28, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "荒謬——", "name": "急切的貴族"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_177"}, {"id": 29, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2168_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 30, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "安靜！", "name": "仲裁人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2168_1#1$1"}, {"id": 31, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "卓婭女士，你的責任是代為陳述娜塔莉婭小姐的證詞，事實判斷是仲裁委員會才能做的。", "name": "仲裁人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2168_1#1$1"}, {"id": 32, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_405_absin_1#1$2"}}, {"id": 33, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……抱歉，仲裁人閣下。", "name": "苦艾"}, "figure_art": "avg_405_absin_1#1$2"}, {"id": 34, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "如果諸位大人在意的是“懺悔”的部分，那麼接下來就是了。", "name": "苦艾"}, "figure_art": "avg_405_absin_1#1$2"}, {"id": 35, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "還請仲裁人閣下允許我繼續。", "name": "苦艾"}, "figure_art": "avg_405_absin_1#1$2"}, {"id": 36, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2168_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 37, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "記住，如果你繼續試圖對任何貴族的觀點進行評判，那麼我將不再允許你發言。", "name": "仲裁人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2168_1#1$1"}, {"id": 38, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "繼續吧。", "name": "仲裁人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2168_1#1$1"}, {"id": 39, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 40, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 41, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 42, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 43, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 44, "prop": "Subtitle", "attributes": {"text": "<i>“當我回到城中，向他們的父母彙報情況時，有的家長會多留我一陣子，想要瞭解更多有關他們孩子的情況。”</i>", "x": 300.0, "y": 330.0, "alignment": "center", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 720.0}}, {"id": 45, "prop": "Subtitle", "attributes": {"text": "<i>“為了尋找緩解封鎖區內境況的契機，我必須要試探誰能夠提供更多的幫助。”</i>", "x": 300.0, "y": 330.0, "alignment": "center", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 720.0}}, {"id": 46, "prop": "Subtitle", "attributes": {"text": "<i>“於是，我挑選了幾位家長私下見面，刻意渲染了學生們所處境況的窘迫與悽慘。”</i>", "x": 300.0, "y": 330.0, "alignment": "center", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 720.0}}, {"id": 47, "prop": "Subtitle", "attributes": {"text": "<i>“最終，我找到了一位獨生子被押的貴族，而他迫不及待地將我引薦給了他的上司。”</i>", "x": 300.0, "y": 330.0, "alignment": "center", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 720.0}}, {"id": 48, "prop": "Subtitle", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 49, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 50, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 51, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_197_poca_1#4$1"}}, {"id": 52, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "72_g13_nobleroom", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 53, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 54, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 55, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$ponder_intro", "key": "$ponder_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 56, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……以上就是我在封鎖區內的全部見聞，議員閣下。", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_197_poca_1#4$1"}, {"id": 57, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_197_poca_1#5$1"}}, {"id": 58, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "若是繼續坐視巴普洛維奇大人的行為，甚至繼續放任他們使用大型武器，這一定會在不久後釀成無法挽回的慘劇。", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_197_poca_1#5$1"}, {"id": 59, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 60, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 61, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2162_1#1$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 62, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 63, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "娜塔莉婭小姐，從你的表述來看，你似乎希望議會能公布巴普洛維奇的罪行，從而剝奪他的樞密官身分，甚至將其撤職。", "name": "某位議員"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2162_1#1$1"}, {"id": 64, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_197_poca_1#12$1"}}, {"id": 65, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我只是希望能阻止他。", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_197_poca_1#12$1"}, {"id": 66, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "議員閣下，請原諒我直接的話語。我對議會既無意評判，也產生不了影響，但我能想像這其中會有多大阻力。", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_197_poca_1#12$1"}, {"id": 67, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2162_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 68, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那麼，或許我們就應該答應他的要求，暫緩拋下封鎖區地塊的決議，然後他就會如約釋放學生們。", "name": "某位議員"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2162_1#1$1"}, {"id": 69, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你相信他會兌現承諾嗎？", "name": "某位議員"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2162_1#1$1"}, {"id": 70, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_197_poca_1#3$1"}}, {"id": 71, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……不，我無法信任巴普洛維奇大人。", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_197_poca_1#3$1"}, {"id": 72, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_197_poca_1#4$1"}}, {"id": 73, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "而且我也明白，您之所以會這麼問我，是因為您同樣無法信任他。", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_197_poca_1#4$1"}, {"id": 74, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2162_1#2$1"}}, {"id": 75, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "哈哈，你很聰明，也許你和我的女兒會聊得來。", "name": "某位議員"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2162_1#2$1"}, {"id": 76, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2162_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 77, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我的下屬也向我報告過，你從封鎖區回來後並沒有按照他的要求，煽動家長們一同想辦法保留封鎖區。", "name": "某位議員"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2162_1#1$1"}, {"id": 78, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "反之，你選擇從家長們的身分、狀況和性格入手，找到了我。", "name": "某位議員"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2162_1#1$1"}, {"id": 79, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你認為我是能左右事情的關鍵，也是你目前能接觸到的、最有政治影響力的對象。", "name": "某位議員"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2162_1#1$1"}, {"id": 80, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_197_poca_1#4$1"}}, {"id": 81, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "您的判斷全都正確，我的想法、那些青澀的算計，在您面前一覽無餘。", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_197_poca_1#4$1"}, {"id": 82, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "可是閣下，我只是無法不去想我的朋友們。就在我們交談的時候，她們正在封鎖區裡遭受磨難，每一秒都有喪命的風險。", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_197_poca_1#4$1"}, {"id": 83, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我知道您的顧慮，是源於我想法的不現實。", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_197_poca_1#4$1"}, {"id": 84, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "所以閣下，我並不奢望能立即處罰巴普洛維奇大人，但至少我們應該爭取改善封鎖區內學生們的待遇，並解除封鎖區的重型武裝。", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_197_poca_1#4$1"}, {"id": 85, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2162_1#3$1"}}, {"id": 86, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……很遺憾，目前的議會大概無法滿足這些請求。", "name": "某位議員"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2162_1#3$1"}, {"id": 87, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_197_poca_1#4$1"}}, {"id": 88, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "巴普洛維奇大人曾和我提到，他得到了議會當中許多貴族朋友的支持。", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_197_poca_1#4$1"}, {"id": 89, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2162_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 90, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你恐怕說漏了一個“舊”字。或者說，“軍事貴族”。", "name": "某位議員"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2162_1#1$1"}, {"id": 91, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "開誠布公地說，烏薩斯貴族間的陣營對立，恐怕對玻利瓦爾人都談不上是什麼秘密了，你不必如此謹慎。", "name": "某位議員"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2162_1#1$1"}, {"id": 92, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "由於近來的動亂，每一個決議、每一條規章，誰今天在議會上逞了口舌之快，誰明日被皇帝陛下誇獎，處處都是黨同伐異，必分高低。", "name": "某位議員"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2162_1#1$1"}, {"id": 93, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "僅是帝國議會，就有四百多名議員，他們大都家世顯赫，功勛卓著。", "name": "某位議員"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2162_1#1$1"}, {"id": 94, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "居住在聖駿堡的、姓氏被計入了《貴族譜系》的世襲貴族，有將近八百人。", "name": "某位議員"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2162_1#1$1"}, {"id": 95, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "至於那些有影響力的榮譽市民，更是不計其數……每個人的態度都很複雜。", "name": "某位議員"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2162_1#1$1"}, {"id": 96, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2162_1#8$1"}}, {"id": 97, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "如果世事都像切薄餅一樣能輕易分成兩半……我想烏薩斯也不會走到現在這種局面。", "name": "某位議員"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2162_1#8$1"}, {"id": 98, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_197_poca_1#5$1"}}, {"id": 99, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "您是想告訴我……", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_197_poca_1#5$1"}, {"id": 100, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "即使是新貴族，其中也有人支持巴普洛維奇大人。現在之所以無法阻止他，也是因為他有許多有權勢的支持者。", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_197_poca_1#5$1"}, {"id": 101, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2162_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 102, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "所以即使是我，甚至是議長，都無法在這件事情上跨過眾人的意見，為你們提供任何實質性的幫助。", "name": "某位議員"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2162_1#1$1"}, {"id": 103, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_197_poca_1#4$1"}}, {"id": 104, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "能有幸與您交流，就已經是莫大的幫助了。", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_197_poca_1#4$1"}, {"id": 105, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我的目標不會改變，想真正解救索尼婭以及封鎖區裡的人們，就必須儘量干擾巴普洛維奇大人。", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_197_poca_1#4$1"}, {"id": 106, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2162_1#2$1"}}, {"id": 107, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "判斷不錯，但只有判斷是不夠的。", "name": "某位議員"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2162_1#2$1"}, {"id": 108, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "在年輕的時候，人們很容易知道自己應該反對什麼，卻很難知道自己應該去做什麼。", "name": "某位議員"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2162_1#2$1"}, {"id": 109, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "娜塔莉婭小姐，你會怎麼做呢？", "name": "某位議員"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2162_1#2$1"}, {"id": 110, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_197_poca_1#2$1"}}, {"id": 111, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……如果我能調查清楚不同人支持他的原因，並且聯絡上一些潛在的“朋友”……", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_197_poca_1#2$1"}, {"id": 112, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_197_poca_1#8$1"}}, {"id": 113, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "您提醒過我，每一個人的態度都是複雜的。換種角度說，即使是舊貴族，即使曾經是他的盟友，也可能會在特定情況下，立場發生轉變。", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_197_poca_1#8$1"}, {"id": 114, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2162_1#2$1"}}, {"id": 115, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你把那句話看作是“提醒”，這還真是……", "name": "某位議員"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2162_1#2$1"}, {"id": 116, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "等事情解決之後，請一定要再來坐坐。等阿洛達沒在做她自己的事的時候吧，也許……", "name": "某位議員"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2162_1#2$1"}, {"id": 117, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_197_poca_1#4$1"}}, {"id": 118, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "您說什麼？", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_197_poca_1#4$1"}, {"id": 119, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2162_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 120, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "沒什麼。", "name": "某位議員"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2162_1#1$1"}, {"id": 121, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "娜塔莉婭小姐，我這裡有一個消息，是即使維特議長明令禁止，也已經在部分貴族中傳播開來的。", "name": "某位議員"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2162_1#1$1"}, {"id": 122, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "冬季舞會之後，出於一些原因，皇帝陛下沒有返回宮殿。", "name": "某位議員"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2162_1#1$1"}, {"id": 123, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_197_poca_1#12$1"}}, {"id": 124, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_197_poca_1#12$1"}, {"id": 125, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2162_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 126, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "截至目前，議長暗中派人調查，卻始終沒有發現任何線索，排除到最後，就只剩下一個地方。", "name": "某位議員"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2162_1#1$1"}, {"id": 127, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2162_1#9$1"}}, {"id": 128, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "一個此時難以查證的地方。", "name": "某位議員"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2162_1#9$1"}, {"id": 129, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_197_poca_1#6$1"}}, {"id": 130, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "難以查證的地方？難道——", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_197_poca_1#6$1"}, {"id": 131, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_197_poca_1#12$1"}}, {"id": 132, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "您的意思是，陛下或許在封鎖區裡……就連議長也沒辦法實施搜查嗎？", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_197_poca_1#12$1"}, {"id": 133, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2162_1#9$1"}}, {"id": 134, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "以目前的局勢來看，我們希望盡可能地低調處理，以免製造出更大的混亂。", "name": "某位議員"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2162_1#9$1"}, {"id": 135, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "而某些不知從何處得知陛下失蹤消息的貴族，卻似乎希望這個局面能夠持續。這也與你告訴我的情況相吻合。", "name": "某位議員"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2162_1#9$1"}, {"id": 136, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……一些利益交換、心照不宣的態度傾斜，又或是想趁機一勞永逸地解決壓在他們頭頂上最大的困難。", "name": "某位議員"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2162_1#9$1"}, {"id": 137, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "更不用說恰好在這時，那原本應該立即啟用以保護陛下的特殊手段，也出於某些原因而反應遲滯。", "name": "某位議員"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2162_1#9$1"}, {"id": 138, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "所以，這個消息並不具有明確的時效性，甚至也不算難以打聽。", "name": "某位議員"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2162_1#9$1"}, {"id": 139, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "重要的是，在特殊手段生效之前，你可以繼續按照你的方式去解決你朋友面臨的問題。而如果特殊手段生效……", "name": "某位議員"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2162_1#9$1"}, {"id": 140, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2162_1#8$1"}}, {"id": 141, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你的朋友們，大概就只能自求多福了。", "name": "某位議員"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2162_1#8$1"}, {"id": 142, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_197_poca_1#8$1"}}, {"id": 143, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……這個特殊手段，是指——", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_197_poca_1#8$1"}, {"id": 144, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2162_1#9$1"}}, {"id": 145, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你只需要知道，當這個手段生效，陛下一定會安全地回到他的宮殿之中。", "name": "某位議員"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2162_1#9$1"}, {"id": 146, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_197_poca_1#12$1"}}, {"id": 147, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_197_poca_1#12$1"}, {"id": 148, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2162_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 149, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不過，我這裡還有一件或許能寬慰你的事。維特議長已經按下了拋下封鎖區的決議，至少在這一週之內都不會改變。", "name": "某位議員"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2162_1#1$1"}, {"id": 150, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_197_poca_1#4$1"}}, {"id": 151, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……您所說的這些，對我們至關重要。我代表我自己，以及我的朋友，一同衷心地感謝您。", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_197_poca_1#4$1"}, {"id": 152, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 153, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 154, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 155, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 156, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "66_g12_deitygrypherburgmeeting", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 157, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 158, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2168_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 159, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……也就是說，有議員向娜塔莉婭小姐透露，某些新貴族希望陛下在封鎖區裡受到折磨，甚至遇害？", "name": "仲裁人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2168_1#1$1"}, {"id": 160, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "儘管聽證會出於維護貴族尊嚴的考量，贊成不公開名字的做法，但請諸位放心，此後會對此進行詳盡的調查。", "name": "仲裁人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2168_1#1$1"}, {"id": 161, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_177"}}, {"id": 162, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不，是誰？是誰已經喪心病狂到這個地步，我要求證人馬上、立即公布那些禽獸的名字！", "name": "急切的貴族"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_177"}, {"id": 163, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "把他們從巢穴裡挖出來，看看他們只為金錢跳動的心臟究竟有沒有長著烏薩斯人的血肉！", "name": "急切的貴族"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_177"}, {"id": 164, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_405_absin_1#1$2"}}, {"id": 165, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "抱歉，我並非娜塔莉婭本人，我對信函裡提到的那些人的名字一無所知。", "name": "苦艾"}, "figure_art": "avg_405_absin_1#1$2"}, {"id": 166, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不過從後文來看，她接下來尋訪了不少歷史悠久的貴族府邸，它們的主人似乎同樣不太熱情……當然，您也可以說他們是不為金錢所動。", "name": "苦艾"}, "figure_art": "avg_405_absin_1#1$2"}, {"id": 167, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_177"}}, {"id": 168, "prop": "multiline", "attributes": {"name": "急切的貴族", "content": "這、這太荒謬了，無論是誰都說出來，不然就是——"}}, {"id": 169, "prop": "multiline", "attributes": {"name": "急切的貴族", "content": "拉我做什麼？"}}, {"id": 170, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 171, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 172, "prop": "CameraShake", "attributes": {"duration": 0.3, "xstrength": 20.0, "ystrength": 20.0, "vibrato": 30.0, "randomness": 90.0, "fadeout": "true", "block": "false"}}, {"id": 173, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_slap"}}, {"id": 174, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 175, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "他下意識地狠狠揮手，清脆的巴掌聲再次驅散了聽證會上難得的凝重，在場所有人好奇地看過去，剛才阻止他的同伴正摀著臉。"}}, {"id": 176, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "同伴面對著眾人的“關切”，只得對他們擠出一個僵硬的訕笑，但雙眼卻惡狠狠地瞟向急切而冒失的貴族，對方悻悻地闔上了嘴巴。"}}, {"id": 177, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_405_absin_1#1$2"}}, {"id": 178, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那，我還應該繼續說嗎？畢竟在這之後，有人給了娜塔莉婭一份軍事貴族的名單，附在這封信件後。", "name": "苦艾"}, "figure_art": "avg_405_absin_1#1$2"}, {"id": 179, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_405_absin_1#7$2"}}, {"id": 180, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "信上寫著，這些貴族未經核驗就咬定陛下的失蹤是謠言，還有人想透過娜塔莉婭趁機勒索那些孩子被抓的家長……", "name": "苦艾"}, "figure_art": "avg_405_absin_1#7$2"}, {"id": 181, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "尤其是在十二月二十九日下午，有一位不願透露姓名的紳士向娜塔莉婭勒索——", "name": "苦艾"}, "figure_art": "avg_405_absin_1#7$2"}, {"id": 182, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2168_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 183, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "等等，你不能透露那些貴族的詳細資訊。", "name": "仲裁人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2168_1#1$1"}, {"id": 184, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_405_absin_1#1$2"}}, {"id": 185, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我會按照要求不公開他們的名字，也不會對他們的行為進行評判。", "name": "苦艾"}, "figure_art": "avg_405_absin_1#1$2"}, {"id": 186, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2168_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 187, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……詳細時間和地點特徵也要規避，不要對我的實質要求故作不知。只說事情，只說事情本身，明白了嗎？！", "name": "仲裁人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2168_1#1$1"}, {"id": 188, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_405_absin_1#1$2"}}, {"id": 189, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "沒有問題，閣下。", "name": "苦艾"}, "figure_art": "avg_405_absin_1#1$2"}, {"id": 190, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "在此之後，雖然娜塔莉婭確實贏得了一部分家長的支持，但最關鍵的是，她在某日登門拜訪了一位重要的貴族人士。", "name": "苦艾"}, "figure_art": "avg_405_absin_1#1$2"}, {"id": 191, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_405_absin_1#9$2"}}, {"id": 192, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "他長期支持巴普洛維奇大人，並始終宣揚應對犯罪學生實施重刑，只要——", "name": "苦艾"}, "figure_art": "avg_405_absin_1#9$2"}, {"id": 193, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 194, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 195, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 196, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 197, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "33_g7_reception", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 198, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 199, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 200, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2165_1#4$1", "duration": 1.5}}, {"id": 201, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.5}}, {"id": 202, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……您認同我們的想法，就能最大限度地降低封鎖區內的交火烈度。", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2165_1#4$1"}, {"id": 203, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 204, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "羅斯托夫家的小姐……請回吧，若不是你放言事態危急，我本沒有和切爾諾伯格的貴族打交道的想法。", "name": "某位公爵"}}, {"id": 205, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2165_1#9$1"}}, {"id": 206, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "公爵閣下，此事關乎陛下安危，誰都承擔不起讓烏薩斯面臨國難的罪責。", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2165_1#9$1"}, {"id": 207, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 208, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "國難？孩子，你或許不知道，這幾年的聖駿堡，每天都有瘋子高喊這個詞——當然，我並不是在說你。", "name": "某位公爵"}}, {"id": 209, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "對於你口中那駭人聽聞的消息，請原諒我不得不故作不知。畢竟我的理智在不斷提醒我——這又是那些暴發戶自導自演的戲碼。", "name": "某位公爵"}}, {"id": 210, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2165_1#3$1"}}, {"id": 211, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "或許是我理解錯了，但您似乎是在指責我們拿陛下的安危演戲，完全不擔心危險發生的後果。", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2165_1#3$1"}, {"id": 212, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 213, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不，我只是不接受訛詐，即使你穿戴得齊整高貴，就像任何一個聖駿堡的貴族那樣。", "name": "某位公爵"}}, {"id": 214, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "在如今的烏薩斯，沒有什麼比教育那些思想中毒的年輕人更為重要。", "name": "某位公爵"}}, {"id": 215, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "如果說，在皇村——在薩列夫格勒區聚眾鬧事都不能嚴懲，烏薩斯還有什麼威信可言？", "name": "某位公爵"}}, {"id": 216, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我可以理解你關心同學的心情，所以不會追究你為暴民辯護的罪責。今天的會面，就當沒有發生過吧。", "name": "某位公爵"}}, {"id": 217, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2165_1#4$1"}}, {"id": 218, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……我明白了，公爵閣下。", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2165_1#4$1"}, {"id": 219, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不過，請相信，您終有一天，也會起身為所謂的“暴民”辯護。", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2165_1#4$1"}, {"id": 220, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 221, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……你說什麼？", "name": "某位公爵"}}, {"id": 222, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 223, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_armycrowd", "volume": 0.5}}, {"id": 224, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 225, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2165_1#12$1"}}, {"id": 226, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我會找到您，是因為我從一些貴族那裡聽聞，您和您的繼承人一直在私底下煽動學生。", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2165_1#12$1"}, {"id": 227, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2165_1#3$1"}}, {"id": 228, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "有人已經掌握了相關證據，能夠證明公爵閣下府邸中的地下室，就是學生活動的據點，甚至拍攝到了他們就在您花園裡排演的畫面。", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2165_1#3$1"}, {"id": 229, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 230, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……呵，無謂的嘗試。孩子，無論你再怎麼虛張聲勢，我也不會上當。", "name": "某位公爵"}}, {"id": 231, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 232, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "他緩緩起身，不再對上娜塔莉婭的目光。"}}, {"id": 233, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我已經警告過你，如果試圖訛詐——", "name": "某位公爵"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2165_1#3$1"}, {"id": 234, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 235, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 236, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 237, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 238, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 239, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 240, "prop": "focusout", "attributes": {"duration": 1.0, "type": "cgitem", "id": "cgitem_72_i06_3", "from": 0.5, "to": 0.5}}, {"id": 241, "prop": "focusout", "attributes": {"duration": 5.0, "type": "cg", "from": 1.0, "to": 0.0}}, {"id": 242, "prop": "cgitem", "attributes": {"image": "cgitem_72_i06_3", "style": "cg", "pfrom": "80,0", "pto": "100,0", "pduration": 20.0, "afrom": 0.0, "ato": 1.0, "aduration": 0.0, "layer": 2.0, "sfrom": 1.0, "sto": 1.0}}, {"id": 243, "prop": "Image", "attributes": {"image": "72_i06_2", "screenadapt": "coverall", "xScale": 1.2, "yScale": 1.2, "y": 30.0}}, {"id": 244, "prop": "ImageTween", "attributes": {"duration": 20.0, "block": "false", "xFrom": 50.0, "xTo": 30.0}}, {"id": 245, "prop": "bgeffect", "attributes": {"name": "$eb_sunlight_r", "layer": 1.0, "y": 200.0, "xto": 200.0, "yto": 200.0, "movetime": 30.0}}, {"id": 246, "prop": "bgeffect", "attributes": {"name": "$eb_sunlight_l", "layer": 2.0, "y": 200.0, "x": 250.0, "xto": 300.0, "yto": 200.0, "movetime": 30.0}}, {"id": 247, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_armycrowd"}}, {"id": 248, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 249, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"key": "$m_avg_ursusdaily_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 250, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 251, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "聽我的指令！隊尾轉隊首，齊步撤退！", "name": "？？？"}}, {"id": 252, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "據我所知，很早就有人猜測您的繼承人與學生組織之間的關係，而您甚至為此威脅過她的老師們，要求禁止這類“謠言”傳播。", "name": "早露"}}, {"id": 253, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但巧的是，自從冬季舞會那時參與示威的學生們被捕後，您的繼承人就再也沒有露面。", "name": "早露"}}, {"id": 254, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那是因為她正在中部研學——", "name": "某位公爵"}}, {"id": 255, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "您當然可以繼續自欺欺人。只是，也許是我自作多情，想當然地認為自己與您有相似的立場，能夠幫您挽回繼承人的前程……", "name": "早露"}}, {"id": 256, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "唉，可憐的奧爾佳。", "name": "早露"}}, {"id": 257, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你、你做了什麼？！", "name": "某位公爵"}}, {"id": 258, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我就在這裡，什麼也沒做。也許只是恰巧在您家裡遇上了他們排練的時刻。", "name": "早露"}}, {"id": 259, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "或者說，連我這樣的不速之客，都能無意間撞見他們的舉動，恰恰說明這些學生在您府中的活躍程度，不是嗎？", "name": "早露"}}, {"id": 260, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你——", "name": "某位公爵"}}, {"id": 261, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 262, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 263, "prop": "bgeffect", "attributes": {"name": "$eb_sunlight_r", "layer": 1.0, "y": 300.0, "x": 300.0}}, {"id": 264, "prop": "bgeffect", "attributes": {"name": "$eb_sunlight_l", "layer": 2.0, "y": 300.0, "x": 300.0}}, {"id": 265, "prop": "cgitem", "attributes": {"image": "cgitem_72_i06_3", "style": "cg", "layer": 2.0, "sfrom": 1.0, "sto": 0.85, "sduration": 30.0, "pfrom": "100,10", "pto": "90,0", "pduration": 30.0}}, {"id": 266, "prop": "focusout", "attributes": {"duration": 10.0, "type": "cgitem", "id": "cgitem_72_i06_3", "from": 0.5, "to": 0.0}}, {"id": 267, "prop": "ImageTween", "attributes": {"xScaleFrom": 1.2, "yScaleFrom": 1.2, "xScaleTo": 1.0, "yScaleTo": 1.0, "yTo": 0.0, "xTo": 0.0, "duration": 30.0}}, {"id": 268, "prop": "focusout", "attributes": {"duration": 30.0, "type": "cg", "from": 0.0, "to": 0.5}}, {"id": 269, "prop": "cgitem", "attributes": {"image": "cgitem_72_i06_1", "style": "cg", "layer": 1.0, "sfrom": 0.85, "sto": 1.0, "sduration": 30.0, "pfrom": "-530,100", "pto": "-430,0", "pduration": 30.0}}, {"id": 270, "prop": "cgitem", "attributes": {"image": "cgitem_72_i06_2", "style": "cg", "layer": 3.0, "sfrom": 0.85, "sto": 1.0, "sduration": 30.0, "pfrom": "570,100", "pto": "470,0", "pduration": 30.0}}, {"id": 271, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 272, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 273, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "窗外陽光炫目，早露垂下眼睛，以無法讓人察覺的幅度點了點頭，旋即換上了屬於貴族小姐的禮貌笑容。"}}, {"id": 274, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "如我所說，我只是聽到了一些傳聞。對公爵閣下而言，幸運的是，它們並沒有擴散。", "name": "早露"}}, {"id": 275, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……你想要什麼？", "name": "某位公爵"}}, {"id": 276, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不是我想要什麼，是您需要守護自己，和整個家族的未來。", "name": "早露"}}, {"id": 277, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "現在剛過正午，希望您能允許我在此稍作休息，靜候您的答覆——", "name": "早露"}}, {"id": 278, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 279, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 280, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 281, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 282, "prop": "image", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 283, "prop": "hidecgitem", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 284, "prop": "bgeffect", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 285, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "66_g12_deitygrypherburgmeeting", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 286, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 287, "prop": "CameraShake", "attributes": {"duration": 0.3, "xstrength": 20.0, "ystrength": 20.0, "vibrato": 30.0, "randomness": 90.0, "fadeout": "true", "block": "false"}}, {"id": 288, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不，不是這樣的！", "name": "？？？"}}, {"id": 289, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這是謊言……仲裁人閣下！", "name": "？？？"}}, {"id": 290, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2168_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 291, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "特里波列夫公爵？", "name": "仲裁人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2168_1#1$1"}, {"id": 292, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 293, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 294, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2171_1#1$1", "duration": 0.5}}, {"id": 295, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 296, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我坦白，娜塔莉婭·羅斯托娃找到的人是我，我也的確同意了削減巴普洛維奇軍備的要求。", "name": "特里波列夫公爵"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2171_1#1$1"}, {"id": 297, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但我的女兒是無罪的！她是被他們、被這群學生組織的瘋子威脅的！", "name": "特里波列夫公爵"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2171_1#1$1"}, {"id": 298, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她會在今天出席作證，勇敢地證明自己的清白，揭露娜塔莉婭的謊言。她就是下一個證人。", "name": "特里波列夫公爵"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2171_1#1$1"}, {"id": 299, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_405_absin_1#6$2"}}, {"id": 300, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "公爵大人，娜塔莉婭的這封信，懺悔的便是對您、對其他人的不誠實。", "name": "苦艾"}, "figure_art": "avg_405_absin_1#6$2"}, {"id": 301, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "烏薩斯從來沒有給過我們機會，而從始至終，娜塔莉婭也沒有背叛任何人，她只是做出了正確的選擇，保護了應當保護的朋友。", "name": "苦艾"}, "figure_art": "avg_405_absin_1#6$2"}, {"id": 302, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "無論誰出面，在這裡發表任何搬弄是非的證詞，她都無愧於烏薩斯，無愧於我們。", "name": "苦艾"}, "figure_art": "avg_405_absin_1#6$2"}, {"id": 303, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2171_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 304, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你——", "name": "特里波列夫公爵"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2171_1#1$1"}, {"id": 305, "prop": "CameraShake", "attributes": {"duration": 0.3, "xstrength": 20.0, "ystrength": 20.0, "vibrato": 30.0, "randomness": 90.0, "fadeout": "true", "block": "false"}}, {"id": 306, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2168_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 307, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$gavel1"}}, {"id": 308, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "肅靜！", "name": "仲裁人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2168_1#1$1"}, {"id": 309, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "臨時休會十分鐘。", "name": "仲裁人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2168_1#1$1"}, {"id": 310, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "書記官，讓下一位證人做好準備……", "name": "仲裁人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2168_1#1$1"}, {"id": 311, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 312, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"duration": 0.5}}, {"id": 313, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_peoplestandup"}}, {"id": 314, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.5}}, {"id": 315, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_177"}}, {"id": 316, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "沃倫佐娃夫人……我不明白，這不像您的作風。", "name": "急切的貴族"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_177"}, {"id": 317, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "您明明拿到了娜塔莉婭真正的證詞，如果能夠與卓婭的說法對峙，至少不會讓列位貴族如此失態。", "name": "急切的貴族"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_177"}, {"id": 318, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但您從她講述封鎖區的遭遇開始就沉默不語，有好幾位大人都在看著您，憤怒溢於言表。", "name": "急切的貴族"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_177"}, {"id": 319, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "您到底在等什麼？", "name": "急切的貴族"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_177"}, {"id": 320, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 321, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "沃倫佐娃夫人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}, {"id": 322, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 323, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 324, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 325, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 326, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 327, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_197_poca_1#4$1"}}, {"id": 328, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "72_g13_nobleroom", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 329, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 330, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"key": "$wasteland_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 331, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……如您所願。", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_197_poca_1#4$1"}, {"id": 332, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 333, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "好，好。這樣，我就還來得及對你的父母有所交代。一切都還來得及。", "name": "沃倫佐娃夫人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}, {"id": 334, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "看，真是漂亮的字跡啊，娜塔申卡。讓我看看你有沒有遺漏——", "name": "沃倫佐娃夫人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}, {"id": 335, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "沃倫佐娃夫人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}, {"id": 336, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……娜塔申卡，你……", "name": "沃倫佐娃夫人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}, {"id": 337, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你寫的這些，都是什麼啊？這不是“懺悔信”嗎？", "name": "沃倫佐娃夫人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}, {"id": 338, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_197_poca_1#4$1"}}, {"id": 339, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "是的，懺悔信。", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_197_poca_1#4$1"}, {"id": 340, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_197_poca_1#15$1"}}, {"id": 341, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我懺悔，向所有曾受我的詭計蒙騙的人，和所有被這些人利用並拋棄的、受難的學生。", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_197_poca_1#15$1"}, {"id": 342, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_197_poca_1#5$1"}}, {"id": 343, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "他們都曾是我的同學，即使我們從未就讀於同一所學校。", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_197_poca_1#5$1"}, {"id": 344, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我們也都是烏薩斯人，我們本該擁有同樣的命運。", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_197_poca_1#5$1"}, {"id": 345, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 346, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不，不！", "name": "沃倫佐娃夫人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}, {"id": 347, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "孩子，我的孩子！是誰要讓你背負這樣的痛苦？是誰指責你欺騙他們？這不是我想讓你做的，絕不是這樣！", "name": "沃倫佐娃夫人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}, {"id": 348, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "天啊，瑪爾莎，我……我該怎麼辦？我該怎麼做才能寬慰你可憐的孩子？不要說這種恐怖的話了，娜塔申卡，這不是你的錯！", "name": "沃倫佐娃夫人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}, {"id": 349, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_197_poca_1#12$1"}}, {"id": 350, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但總有人應該為此付出代價，或背負罪責，夫人。", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_197_poca_1#12$1"}, {"id": 351, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我寫下這些，按照您的要求描述這些人的參與，以及……我所知道的故事。您卻說，這不是我應該做的。", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_197_poca_1#12$1"}, {"id": 352, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "難道我剖開自己的做法不對嗎？還是說我應該永遠對責任敬而遠之，就像個永遠長不大的孩子？", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_197_poca_1#12$1"}, {"id": 353, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 354, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "在我們面前，你們永遠都只是孩子！我也只是想幫助你，像幫助任何一個朋友的親人——甚至像幫助自己的孩子。", "name": "沃倫佐娃夫人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}, {"id": 355, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不過是些荒唐的、盡可以被原諒的錯誤，誰需要這樣沉重的懺悔？我絕不願看你自苦至此，我的……娜塔申卡……", "name": "沃倫佐娃夫人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}, {"id": 356, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_197_poca_1#4$1"}}, {"id": 357, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我明白，夫人，我都明白。", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_197_poca_1#4$1"}, {"id": 358, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "您的熱情，您的真摯，甚至常常達到使我在相處中覺得煎熬的程度。但這並不是您的問題。", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_197_poca_1#4$1"}, {"id": 359, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_197_poca_1#3$1"}}, {"id": 360, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "只是我自己，在這些日子接觸到太多以往遙不可及的高貴之人後，在親身瞭解了他們的所思所想和對烏薩斯的感情後，總忍不住去想——", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_197_poca_1#3$1"}, {"id": 361, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_197_poca_1#5$1"}}, {"id": 362, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "駿鷹王國尚未滅亡的時候，如今的烏薩斯貴族們的祖先，也都是一個個普通人，就連伊戈爾大帝也只是軍旅行伍中的一員。", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_197_poca_1#5$1"}, {"id": 363, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_197_poca_1#12$1"}}, {"id": 364, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "在駿鷹揮動著鞭子的時候，他們毫無畏懼地衝了上去，擋在被奴役者的身前。這才讓大家相信，他們擁有榮耀的、勇者的血脈。", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_197_poca_1#12$1"}, {"id": 365, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但若是有一天，這些流淌著勇者血液的人，選擇將另一些被壓迫和被侮辱的人踩在腳下，甚至拿起了駿鷹曾揮動的鞭子……", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_197_poca_1#12$1"}, {"id": 366, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_197_poca_1#15$1"}}, {"id": 367, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "還會有人相信他們，甘願與他們為伍嗎？", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_197_poca_1#15$1"}, {"id": 368, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_197_poca_1#9$1"}}, {"id": 369, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "而我，竟然也要加入，作為其中的一員嗎？", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_197_poca_1#9$1"}, {"id": 370, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 371, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這是……我們與生俱來的權利——", "name": "沃倫佐娃夫人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}, {"id": 372, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "娜塔申卡，不……", "name": "沃倫佐娃夫人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}, {"id": 373, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_197_poca_1#4$1"}}, {"id": 374, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不，夫人，只有這一次，請容我拒絕。", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_197_poca_1#4$1"}, {"id": 375, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "如果說，有什麼權利是我希望所有人都能與生俱來的，那一定是……", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_197_poca_1#4$1"}, {"id": 376, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_197_poca_1#5$1"}}, {"id": 377, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "“選擇權”。", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_197_poca_1#5$1"}, {"id": 378, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 379, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "沃倫佐娃夫人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}, {"id": 380, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_197_poca_1#4$1"}}, {"id": 381, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "而現在，正如您所說……“一切都還來得及”。", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_197_poca_1#4$1"}, {"id": 382, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "來得及讓我做出選擇，來得及讓我決定背負。", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_197_poca_1#4$1"}, {"id": 383, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 384, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 385, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 386, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 387, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 388, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "66_g12_deitygrypherburgmeeting", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 389, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 390, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……只是，沒有必要。", "name": "沃倫佐娃夫人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}, {"id": 391, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "“再怎麼精心編造的謊言，也敵不過切身經歷的事實”。娜塔申卡……只是做出了選擇。", "name": "沃倫佐娃夫人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}, {"id": 392, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_177"}}, {"id": 393, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但她矇騙了您，至少要讓她付出代價——", "name": "急切的貴族"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_177"}, {"id": 394, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 395, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "大人，我感謝您的熱心，只不過……", "name": "沃倫佐娃夫人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}, {"id": 396, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我已經有點累了。", "name": "沃倫佐娃夫人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}, {"id": 397, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 398, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 399, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 400, "prop": "bgeffect", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 401, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 402, "prop": "hidecgitem", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 403, "prop": "Image", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 404, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 405, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": ""}}], "OPTIONTRACE": true}